From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:36:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Initialize development chainstate from an explicit validated
 genesis manifest

Require exact nonzero genesis identity, canonical target and work, zero native issuance and unchanged initial monetary state. Derive spendable genesis coins under C17 and prune burns, then atomically persist genesis with restart history. Reopen verifies stored tip commitments and retained body availability. Parameters remain caller supplied; no network or daemon path is enabled. Companion independent initializer tests cover malformed artifacts, zero-value coins, reopen and interrupted initialization.
